            <div class="col-lg-8 content-page-wrapper" id="content-wrapper">
                <h1>Guidance by Sector</h1>

                
                

                
                <p>This section of the website provides information for companies raising money in the mining and financial technology sectors. BC is considered a global centre for capital raising by junior mining companies, while financial technology (fintech) is a rapidly evolving area bringing innovation to the financial sector.</p>

                
